  "fullContentHtml": "\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">UKSSSC VDO, Patwari &amp; Other Post Admit Card 2026</h1>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-06-09T11:28:51+05:30\">June 9, 2026</time></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">11:28 am</span>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://sssc.uk.gov.in/\">Uttarakhand Subordinate Service Selection Commission UKSSSC</a>,</strong> has released the<strong> Admit Card</strong>&nbsp;on its <strong>official website</strong> for the <strong>Village Development Officer (VDO), Patwari, Lekhpal, Village Panchayat Development Officer (VPDO), Personal Assistant &amp; Other Various Post&nbsp;Examination 2025.</strong> The exam will be conducted on&nbsp;<strong>14 June 2026,</strong>&nbsp;and the last date to submit the application form was&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"230\" data-end=\"250\">15 May 2025</strong>. Candidates can check their&nbsp;<strong>Admit Card&nbsp;</strong>using their&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"362\">Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth</strong> by logging into the <strong>portal. The direct link</strong> is provided below. <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>(Advt. No. 70/2025)</strong></span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- WhatsApp Button --> <a class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> WhatsApp </a> <!-- Telegram Button --> <a class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Telegram </a></div>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\">\n\n<h2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\">UKSSSC VDO, Patwari &amp; Other Post Admit Card 2026</h2>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">UKSSSC VDO, Patwari &amp; Other Post Examination 2025 : Short Details</h3>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/uksssc-vdo-other-post-2025/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Start Date : <strong>15 April 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Last Date : <strong>15 May 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Last Date For Fee Payment : <strong>15 May 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Correction Date : <strong>18-20 May 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: #ffff00;\">Exam Date : 14 June 2026</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Admit Card :&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>08 June 2026 (Available Now)</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Result Date : <strong>Will Be Updated Here Soon</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates are advised to confirm from the <b>UKSSSC</b>&nbsp;official website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For<strong> General/ OBC </strong>: <strong>₹ 300/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>SC/ ST/ EWS</strong>&nbsp;: <strong>₹ 150/-</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Payment Mode (Online):</strong> You can make the payment using the following methods:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Debit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Credit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Internet Banking</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">IMPS</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Cash Card / Mobile Wallet</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">UKSSSC VDO, Patwari &amp; Other Post Notification 2025 : Age Limits As On 01 July 2025</h5>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><p><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For&nbsp;Patwari&nbsp;Post:</span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Minimum Age&nbsp;<b>: 21 Years</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age&nbsp;<b>: 38 Years</b></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For&nbsp;Lekhpal&nbsp;Post:</span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Minimum Age&nbsp;<b>: 21 Years</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age&nbsp;<b>: 35 Years</b></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For All Other Post:</span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Minimum Age&nbsp;<b>: 21 Years</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age&nbsp;<b>: 42 Years</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>UKSSSC</strong> provides age relaxation for the&nbsp;<strong>VDO, Patwari &amp; Other Post&nbsp;</strong>position as per their regulations.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">416 Post</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\">\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\">UKSSSC VDO, Patwari &amp; Other Post Recruitment 2025 : Vacancy Details</h6>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.7198%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.6948%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>No. Of Post</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 60.5853%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.7198%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Village Development Officer (VDO)</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.6948%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">205</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 60.5853%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Graduation degree from a recognized university or an equivalent degree approved by the government.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.7198%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Patwari</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.6948%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">119</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 60.5853%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have a Bachelor’s degree from any recognized university. For the physical efficiency test, males must run 7 km in 60 minutes, and females must run 3.5 km in 35 minutes. Physical standards include a minimum height of 168 cm for males and 152 cm for females. Male candidates must have a chest measurement of 84 cm with at least 5 cm expansion, and female candidates must weigh at least 45 kg.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.7198%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Lekhpal</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.6948%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">61</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 60.5853%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must hold a Bachelor’s degree from any recognized university. For the physical efficiency test, male candidates must run 7 km in 60 minutes, while female candidates must run 3.5 km in 35 minutes.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.7198%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Village Panchayat Development Officer (VPDO)</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.6948%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">01</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 60.5853%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have a Bachelor’s degree from any recognized university and also possess a minimum CCC level certificate in computer operation.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.7198%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Assistant Superintendent</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.6948%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">05</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 60.5853%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have a Bachelor’s degree with Sociology as a subject from any recognized university, along with one year of administrative work experience in a government organization or a recognized voluntary organization.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.7198%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Assistant Review Officer (ARO)</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.6948%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">03</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 60.5853%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have a graduation degree from any recognized university, along with a Diploma in Computer Science or an O Level certificate from DOEACC Society. A minimum typing speed of 4000 key depressions per hour in Hindi is also mandatory.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.7198%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Personal Assistant (PA)</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.6948%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">03</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 60.5853%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have a graduation degree from any recognized university along with a one-year computer course certificate, <strong>OR</strong> a graduation degree with Computer Science as a subject. They must also have a minimum speed of 80 words per minute in Hindi shorthand and 8000 key depressions per hour in Hindi typing on a computer. Candidates who achieve a minimum speed of 100 wpm in English shorthand and 9000 key depressions per hour in English typing will be eligible for the bilingual allowance.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.7198%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Swagati</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.6948%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">03</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 60.5853%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have a graduation degree from any recognized university, with the ability to read, write, and speak both Hindi and English, along with knowledge of Information Technology and Computers.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.7198%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Sahayak Swagati</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.6948%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">01</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 60.5853%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have a graduation degree from any recognized university, with proficiency in reading, writing, and speaking Hindi and English, along with knowledge of Information Technology and computers.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #800000;\">You May Also Check :</span></strong></span> <strong><a class=\"wp-block-latest-posts__post-title\" href=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/niacl-assistants-online-form-2024/\">NIACL Assistants Online Form 2024</a></strong></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;How To Check &amp; Download UKSSSC VDO, Patwari &amp; Other Post Admit Card 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"192\" data-end=\"231\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"192\" data-end=\"229\">Go to the Official UKSSSC Website</strong></span></li>\n<li data-start=\"237\" data-end=\"331\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Open the official site of the Uttarakhand Subordinate Service Selection Commission (UKSSSC).</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"336\" data-end=\"369\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"336\" data-end=\"367\">Find the Admit Card Section</strong></span></li>\n<li data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"478\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">On the homepage, look for the <strong data-start=\"405\" data-end=\"435\">“Admit Card / Hall Ticket”</strong> or <strong data-start=\"439\" data-end=\"470\">“Examination / Recruitment”</strong> link.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"484\" data-end=\"558\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">You will see the admit card notification for <strong data-start=\"529\" data-end=\"555\">VDO &amp; other posts 2025</strong>.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"597\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"595\">Click on the Admit Card Link</strong></span></li>\n<li data-start=\"603\" data-end=\"699\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Select the option related to your exam (Village Development Officer &amp; other advertised posts).</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"733\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"731\">Login with Your Details</strong></span></li>\n<li data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"823\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Enter your <strong data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"787\">Registration Number / Roll Number</strong> and <strong data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"820\">Date of Birth / Password</strong>.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"874\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Fill in the captcha/security code if asked.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"913\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"911\">View and Download Admit Card</strong></span></li>\n<li data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"963\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Your admit card will appear on the screen.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"1057\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Check your <strong data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"1044\">exam date, exam city, reporting time, and other instructions</strong> carefully.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1088\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1086\">Print the Admit Card</strong></span></li>\n<li data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1160\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Download the PDF and take at least <strong data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1146\">2–3 printouts</strong> for safety.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1218\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Keep a soft copy saved on your phone/PC as backup.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;UKSSSC VDO, Patwari &amp; Other Post Recruitment 2025 : </span>Mode Of Selection&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Written Examination</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Physical Efficiency Test</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Document Verification</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\">Join Our WhatsApp Channel</span></strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Follow Now</a></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\">Join Our Telegram Channel</span></strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Follow Now</a></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-cbf2939c gb-headline-text\"><strong><strong><strong>SOME USEFUL IMPORTANT LINKS</strong></strong></strong></h6>\n\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-761d9c16\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4b7d6947 importaint_links gb-headline-text\"></p><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><strong>Download Admit Card</strong></h5>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><a href=\"https://uksssc.co.in/admitAdvt70REexamV02/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><str